      <activity id="84e964f8-aac8-5453-8f59-0ab1b15fce65" activityNameId="62e01c30-1c7d-597f-ae3a-22c578bbfe65" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biomethane, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW (proj. 210)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biomethane, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW (proj. 210)
Inventory for 1 MJ biomethane, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours.;
Synonyms: Biogas, aufbereitet, in Heizkessel kond. mod. 50kW; 
UUID: 4967b2bb-8839-3641-b8ab-0be01b64d1a6
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland. 
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: This inventory is based on the natural gas, burned in boiler inventory and adjusted regarding the biomethane input and the biogenic CO, CO2 and CH4 emissions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4967b2bb-8839-3641-b8ab-0be01b64d1a6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
